{"articleNo":"242010","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=242010&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2020-2 폐강과목 안내 및 수강신청 정정신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.09.08","hit":"8704","attachments":[{"name":"홈피2020-2학기_폐강대상강좌_내역(공지용).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=242010&attachNo=91073"},{"name":"폐강과목+수강정정신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=242010&attachNo=91087"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2020-2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">학기 폐강과목을 아래와 같이 공고하오니 대상과목을 수강 신청한 학생은 다른 과목으로 수강정정 기간 내에 변경하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">정정신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2020. 9</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">.(</span><font face=\"함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">수</span></font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">), 10:00</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">부터 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">~&nbsp; 9.10.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">), 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">까지 (승인:9.9.~9.11.)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2. 정정신청 가능 대상:&nbsp;</span><u><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">폐강된 과목에</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">수강 신청한 학생</span></b></u></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">정정방법</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청할 과목에<b> 여석이 없을 경우</b></span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; “</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">원스톱서비스</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">학사관리</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청 변경 및 정정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">에서 수강 정정신청</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청 전 반드시 수강가능여부를 확인할것</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">신청할 과목에 <b>여석이 있을 경우</b></span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 붙임의 “폐강과목 수강정정 신청서[서식]”를 작성하여&nbsp;교무처로 제출(<a><u>gmg0416@kumoh.ac.kr</u></a>)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">유의사항</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">본인이 신청한 과목 중 폐강된 과목수 만큼만 변경이 가능합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">정정한 과목에 대해서는 수업시간에 반드시 출석부 확인을 하여야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">붙임&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2020-2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">학기 합반,분반 및 폐강대상 강좌내역 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" data-jsonlen=\"12192\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 1,\n\"dv\": 0,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.1\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"10, 0, 0, 9139\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_8\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2020-09-08T16:59:42.114Z\",\n\"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\": false,\n\"at\": false,\n\"tq\": false,\n\"da\": false,\n\"dw\": false,\n\"dj\": false,\n\"bc\": false,\n\"bu\": false,\n\"al\": false,\n\"ab\": false,\n\"ap\": false,\n\"an\": false,\n\"aa\": false,\n\"ds\": false,\n\"de\": false,\n\"as\": false,\n\"cp\": false,\n\"ao\": false,\n\"et\": false,\n\"ay\": false,\n\"am\": false,\n\"a1\": false,\n\"bt\": false,\n\"av\": false,\n\"dh\": false,\n\"dp\": false,\n\"d1\": false,\n\"mf\": false,\n\"bl\": false,\n\"ag\": false,\n\"dg\": false,\n\"ae\": false,\n\"df\": false,\n\"do\": false,\n\"dl\": false,\n\"di\": false,\n\"d2\": false,\n\"d3\": false,\n\"ob\": false,\n\"d4\": false,\n\"ev\": false,\n\"d5\": fa